  "description": "Legendary creators Lee Hyeon-Se and Lee Du-Hu personally produced Hell Camp Short Story Collection Season Eight! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\nStories Included:\n1. **STILL ALIVE** (STILL ALIVE) \\[Kingman\\]\n2. **Saebyeok Nesi Kaereolsong** (새벽 네시 캐럴송) \\[ Yeoun\\]\n3. **Gwisineul Boneun Ai** (귀신을 보는 아이) \\[Sunkki\\]\n4. **Lovely ♡ Ppakppagi** (러블리♡빡빡이) \\[Suk-Jin Byeon\\]\n5. **Gyae** (걔) \\[Yeong-Chae Hae\\]\n6. **Helster** (헬스터) \\[Jeonglian\\]\n7. **Yeonggameul Chajaseo** (영감을 찾아서) \\[Jeyang\\]\n8. **Joemok** (죄목) \\[Nu-Ruk Sin\\]\n9. **Gudakdari Satang** (구닥다리 사탕) \\[Yeong Eun\\]\n10. **Saejang** (새장) \\[Dorandi\\]\n11. **Dreams Come True** (드림스 컴 트루) \\[Il-Gong Yuk\\]\n12. **Goyangiseome Eoseooseyo** (고양이섬에 어서오세요) \\[Su-Min Park\\]\n13. **Kkot Dokkaebijeon** (꽃 도깨비전) \\[Alpha A\\]\n14. **origin** (origin) \\[Min-Uk Jeong\\]\n15. **light blue** (light blue) \\[Eun-Ji Hong\\]\n16. **Iljinsanyang** (일진사냥) \\[Seoseo\\]\n17. **Eonjena Myeot Beonirado** (언제나 몇 번이라도) \\[Kang-Hui Han\\]\n18. **Kkotdoduk** (꽃도둑) \\[Yeong-Jin Ju\\]\n19. **Bit** (빛) \\[Sang-Ki Hong\\]\n20. **Sopunggachi** (소풍같이) \\[Deupo\\]",
